{"overview":{"Symbol":"CBRS","Name":"Cerebras Systems Inc.","Description":"Cerebras Systems Inc. operates as an artificial intelligence infrastructure company. It designs and manufactures an AI compute platform that comprises of proprietary systems and software that is delivered in racks for deployment in data centers up to supercomputer scale. The company's pioneering wafer-scale engine, a chip encompassing a silicon wafer, designed to enable higher performance and speeds than GPUs for the computational demands of inference, Generative AI, and other AI applications. Its customers include hyperscalers, foundation model labs, AI-native and digital-native businesses, enterprises, and leaders of Sovereign AI initiatives. The company has operations in the United States, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and internationally. Cerebras Systems Inc. was founded in 2015 and is headquartered in Sunnyvale, California.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGS","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Technology","Industry":"Semiconductors","Address":"1237 East Arques Avenue, Sunnyvale, CA, 94085, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"50551009280","EBITDA":"-111408000","PERatio":"535.31396","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"-10.149","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"0.43","RevenuePerShareTTM":"9.512","ProfitMargin":"0.46633998","OperatingMarginTTM":"-0.30653","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.05302","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"0.38422","RevenueTTM":"509991008","GrossProfitTTM":"199071008","DilutedEPSTTM":"0.43","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"14.744","AnalystTargetPrice":"294","TrailingPE":"535.31396","ForwardPE":"273.0999","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"99.121376","PriceToBookRatio":"","EVToRevenue":"27.595","EVToEBITDA":"-126.321","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"386.34","52WeekLow":"196.73","50DayMovingAverage":"252.19579","200DayMovingAverage":"252.19579","SharesOutstanding":"34500000","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEq